{"text": "Jacob Marley was dead, and he had been dead for seven years. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His business partner, Ebenezer Scrooge, was a man who loved only money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was as hard and sharp as flint, and his heart was as cold as ice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On Christmas Eve, Scrooge sat busy in his counting house, and it was bitterly cold. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> His clerk, Bob Cratchit, worked in a tiny room with a very small fire. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bob tried to warm himself at his candle, but he failed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then Scrooges nephew Fred came in and cheerfully wished him a merry Christmas. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bah, Humbug, said Scrooge, and he refused to come to Christmas dinner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Next, two gentlemen visited the office to collect money for the poor. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Are there no prisons, asked Scrooge, Those who are poor must go there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If they would rather die, they had better do it, he said coldly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At closing time, Scrooge grumbled that Bob wanted the whole day off for Christmas.", "alignment": {"characters": ["J", "a", "c", "o", "b", " ", "M", "a", "r", "l", "e", "y", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "d", "e", "a", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "b", "e", "e", "n", " ", "d", "e", "a", "d", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "s", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "y", "e", "a", "r", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "i", "s", " ", "b", "u", "s", "i", "n", "e", "s", "s", " ", "p", "a", "r", "t", "n", "e", "r", ",", " ", "E", "b", "e", "n", "e", "z", "e", "r", " ", "S", "c", "r", "o", "o", "g", "e", ",", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "o", "v", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "m", "o", "n", "e", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", 